Build the X11 parts of Electron only when the X11 ozone platform is enabled.

Electron is only ever built with both ozone platforms, so X11 code has
leaked out of its SUPPORTS_OZONE_X11 guards: the X11 event and device
targets and libxshmfence are linked for every Linux build (and assert
ozone_platform_x11 in gn), the desktop capturer, native window and GTK
menu code use X11 types and helpers under a plain IS_LINUX, and the
offscreen display client overrides a method Chromium only declares when
the X11 platform is built.

